{"3407520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Command or Engage", "steam_appid": 3407520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command or Engage is a modern Action Combat / Role Playing game set in various terrain styles and settings, Build units from buildings, fight along side your troops to take control points, build gold mines and farms and maybe help them gather resources to support more troops, or wander off from the battle and engage various monsters and enemies for a chance at some good loot while you level up and get stronger, challenge people to a 2.5D street fight if you're game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Soldier with an arsenal and command units.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/73a4d16300f7ab93a7de4c66e03dd60e.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/73a4d16300f7ab93a7de4c66e03dd60e.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/73a4d16300f7ab93a7de4c66e03dd60e.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/66dacd3ab073dee938203694fef3d79b.avif?t=1760224130\" width=700 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Farmers, bakers and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/4bdc617a27d35cc54aa908a3e3572f2f.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/4bdc617a27d35cc54aa908a3e3572f2f.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/4bdc617a27d35cc54aa908a3e3572f2f.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/899804c275a9563ec37526b4852ed80b.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/899804c275a9563ec37526b4852ed80b.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/899804c275a9563ec37526b4852ed80b.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/9f3aaaa7bde8436cacc864fce01414db.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/9f3aaaa7bde8436cacc864fce01414db.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/9f3aaaa7bde8436cacc864fce01414db.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>SOLDIERS POINT OF VIEW</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the year 2050, where governments are fighting over control of an unstable worm hole, the first side to discover the right frequency to use it, will have access to a time portal, armies will fight to control sections of the map, and also fight the mysterious rumoured magic users, engaging both sides for an unknown reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Shape Shifting Mage Shooting Energy Balls, Fire Balls and More.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/a86acc6b7f531c88b7b145621fe4413f.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/a86acc6b7f531c88b7b145621fe4413f.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/a86acc6b7f531c88b7b145621fe4413f.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/d795209ed2dc56e0e94d433facec7f99.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/d795209ed2dc56e0e94d433facec7f99.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/d795209ed2dc56e0e94d433facec7f99.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/186d16b626670046d05b21af78c8d82e.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/186d16b626670046d05b21af78c8d82e.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/186d16b626670046d05b21af78c8d82e.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/fe1ca59244049c7fe92e8147ad9e09b5.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/fe1ca59244049c7fe92e8147ad9e09b5.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/fe1ca59244049c7fe92e8147ad9e09b5.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MAGIC USERS POINT OF VIEW</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year for us is 4500, we are no longer the dominant species of the planet, instead we fight to maintain what little of the planet we occupy, we have finally decided to use our forbidden time portal and go back to where it all started, we will do anything to stop our former selves from activating the worm hole, some thing have already entered their world, but once they have access to it completely, that's when the bigger ones start coming through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Powerful Shapeshifting Vampire, watching and selecting your victims.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ffba86abdd6c2d9670ac5b4817a5f9f0.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ffba86abdd6c2d9670ac5b4817a5f9f0.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ffba86abdd6c2d9670ac5b4817a5f9f0.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/2926855e8ef1a6d50401ef208ab1d948.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/2926855e8ef1a6d50401ef208ab1d948.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/2926855e8ef1a6d50401ef208ab1d948.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Unique abilities to Destroy your opponents.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/bd0df7c1be9cbc8cc099ff45b6656e09.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/bd0df7c1be9cbc8cc099ff45b6656e09.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/bd0df7c1be9cbc8cc099ff45b6656e09.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humans are weak prey.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/44a00ed482f4ba1cd506357ad2463ebb.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/44a00ed482f4ba1cd506357ad2463ebb.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/44a00ed482f4ba1cd506357ad2463ebb.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill Challenging AI for loot.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/45f21f413ab014470a9307a0917bbe17.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/45f21f413ab014470a9307a0917bbe17.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/45f21f413ab014470a9307a0917bbe17.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/0afeaae54001e66e35f9cc71aa082140.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/0afeaae54001e66e35f9cc71aa082140.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/0afeaae54001e66e35f9cc71aa082140.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or Come and watch the fights and do some trading.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ef1087b9416177bbac60cfe5faadb720.poster