0224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/9f3aaaa7bde8436cacc864fce01414db.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/9f3aaaa7bde8436cacc864fce01414db.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/9f3aaaa7bde8436cacc864fce01414db.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>SOLDIERS POINT OF VIEW</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the year 2050, where governments are fighting over control of an unstable worm hole, the first side to discover the right frequency to use it, will have access to a time portal, armies will fight to control sections of the map, and also fight the mysterious rumoured magic users, engaging both sides for an unknown reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Shape Shifting Mage Shooting Energy Balls, Fire Balls and More.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/a86acc6b7f531c88b7b145621fe4413f.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/a86acc6b7f531c88b7b145621fe4413f.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/a86acc6b7f531c88b7b145621fe4413f.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"