us is 4500, we are no longer the dominant species of the planet, instead we fight to maintain what little of the planet we occupy, we have finally decided to use our forbidden time portal and go back to where it all started, we will do anything to stop our former selves from activating the worm hole, some thing have already entered their world, but once they have access to it completely, that's when the bigger ones start coming through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Powerful Shapeshifting Vampire, watching and selecting your victims.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ffba86abdd6c2d9670ac5b4817a5f9f0.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ffba86abdd6c2d9670ac5b4817a5f9f0.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/ffba86abdd6c2d9670ac5b4817a5f9f0.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/2926855e8ef1a6d50401ef208ab1d948.poster.avif?t=1760224130\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/2926855e8ef1a6d50401ef208ab1d948.webm?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407520/extras/2926855e8ef1a6d50401ef208ab1d948.mp4?t=1760224130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Unique abilities to Destroy your opponents.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"